Package: pve-triton-virglrenderer
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, pve-triton-dxvk
Description: virglrenderer with Neptune D3D11 render server (Triton stack)
 Fork of utmapp/virglrenderer (dev/neptune-linux branch) built with
 -Dneptune=true -Dvenus=true. Provides the virgl_render_server which
 deserializes Neptune D3D11 API calls from QEMU virtio-gpu and executes
 them on the host via the pve-triton-dxvk libraries. Installed under
 /usr/lib/pve-triton/virglrenderer.
 Upstream: https://github.com/utmapp/virglrenderer
